@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.98(1) (src:1549)
`reg 77.98(1) the purpose of Pilot Project No. 19 beyond its own` MEANS
    "test which method, the one described in subsection 77.94(3) or the one described in subsection 77.97(3), is more effective in encouraging claimants to work more while receiving benefits"

-- src:1550 | (2) A claimant may elect to have subsection 77.94(3), instead of subsection 77.97(3), apply to earnings received during all weeks of unemployment included in a benefit period, or the portion of a benefit period, that falls within the period beginning on August 2, 2015 and ending on August 6, 2016 if the claimant
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.98(2) (src:1550)
`reg 77.98(2) the period of the earnings to which an election applies` MEANS
    `Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2015 8 2), (YearMonthDay 2016 8 6)

-- (2) A claimant may elect to have 77.94(3), instead of 77.97(3), apply to earnings received during all weeks of unemployment in a benefit period, or the portion of it, that falls within the period from August 2, 2015
-- to August 6, 2016, if the claimant (a) had earnings subject to 77.94(3) during the period from August 7, 2011 to August 4, 2012; and (b) made every election they were entitled to make under 77.96, other than an election
-- in respect of a benefit period that began before August 2, 2015 if the last notification in respect of it is issued on or after August 2, 2015.
-- src:1550 | (2) A claimant may elect to have subsection 77.94(3), instead of subsection 77.97(3), apply to earnings received during all weeks of unemployment included in a benefit period, or the portion of a benefit period, that falls within the period beginning on August 2, 2015 and ending on August 6, 2016 if the claimant
-- src:1551 | (a) had earnings that were subject to subsection 77.94(3) during the period beginning on August 7, 2011 and ending on August 4, 2012; and
-- src:1552 | (b) made every election that they were entitled to make under section 77.96, other than an election in respect of a benefit period that began before August 2, 2015 if the last notification of payment or non-payment of benefits in respect of one or more weeks of unemployment included in that benefit period is issued to the claimant on or after August 2, 2015.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.98(2) (src:1550-1552)
GIVEN `the claimant had earnings that were subject to subsection 77.94(3) during the period beginning on August 7, 2011 and ending on August 4, 2012` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the claimant made every election that they were entitled to make under section 77.96, other than an election in respect of a benefit period that began before August 2, 2015 if the last notification in respect of it is issued on or after August 2, 2015` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 77.98(2) the claimant may elect` IF
        `the claimant had earnings that were subject to subsection 77.94(3) during the period beginning on August 7, 2011 and ending on August 4, 2012`
    AND `the claimant made every election that they were entitled to make under section 77.96, other than an election in respect of a benefit period that began before August 2, 2015 if the last notification in respect of it is issued on or after August 2, 2015`

-- (3) Any election made under section 77.96 in respect of a benefit period is deemed to apply to earnings received during all weeks of unemployment in the portion of that benefit period that falls within the period from
-- August 2, 2015 to August 6, 2016 if the last notification in respect of weeks of that benefit period is issued to the claimant on or after August 2, 2015.
-- src:1553 | (3) Any election made under section 77.96 in respect of a benefit period is deemed to apply to earnings received during all weeks of unemployment included in the portion of that benefit period that falls within the period beginning on August 2, 2015 and ending on August 6, 2016 if the last notification of payment or non-payment of benefits in respect of one or more weeks of unemployment included in that benefit period is issued to the claimant on or after August 2, 2015.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.98(3) (src:1553)
GIVEN `an election was made under section 77.96 in respect of the benefit period` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day on which the last notification of payment or non-payment of benefits in respect of one or more weeks of unemployment included in the benefit period is issued to the claimant` IS A DATE
