§§ `Reg 77.991 - Pilot Project No. 20, the election`

-- src:1569 | 77.991 (1) The purpose of Pilot Project No. 20 is also to test which method, the one described in subsection 77.94(3) or the one described in subsection 77.99(3), is more effective in encouraging claimants to work more while receiving benefits.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.991(1) (src:1569)
`reg 77.991(1) the purpose of Pilot Project No. 20 beyond its own` MEANS
    "test which method, the one described in subsection 77.94(3) or the one described in subsection 77.99(3), is more effective in encouraging claimants to work more while receiving benefits"

-- src:1570 | (2) A claimant may elect to have subsection 77.94(3), instead of subsection 77.99(3), apply to earnings received during all weeks of unemployment included in a benefit period, or the portion of a benefit period, that falls within the period beginning on August 7, 2016 and ending on August 11, 2018.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.991(2) (src:1570)
`reg 77.991(2) the period of the earnings to which an election applies` MEANS
    `Period of days` OF (YearMonthDay 2016 8 7), (YearMonthDay 2018 8 11)

-- (3) Any election made under section 77.98 in respect of a benefit period is deemed to apply to earnings received during all weeks of unemployment in the portion of that benefit period that falls within the period
-- from August 7, 2016 to August 11, 2018 if the last notification in respect of weeks of that benefit period is issued to the claimant on or after August 7, 2016.
