    AND `the day on which the last notification of payment or non-payment of benefits in respect of one or more weeks of unemployment included in the benefit period is issued to the claimant` AT LEAST (YearMonthDay 2016 8 7)

-- (4) A claimant who was eligible to make an election under 77.98 in respect of a benefit period that began before August 7, 2016 and has not ended on or before that day may make an election under (2) in respect of that
-- benefit period if the last notification of payment or non-payment in respect of it is issued to the claimant on or after August 7, 2016.
-- src:1572 | (4) A claimant who was eligible to make an election under section 77.98 in respect of a benefit period that began before August 7, 2016 and has not ended on or before that day may make an election under subsection (2) in respect of that benefit period if the last notification of payment or non-payment of benefits in respect of that benefit period is issued to the claimant on or after August 7, 2016.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.991(4) (src:1572)
GIVEN `the claimant was eligible to make an election under section 77.98 in respect of the benefit period` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day on which the benefit period began` IS A DATE
      `the day on which the benefit period ended, if it has` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the day on which the last notification of payment or non-payment of benefits in respect of the benefit period is issued to the claimant` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 77.991(4) the claimant may make an election under subsection 77.991(2) in respect of the benefit period` IF
        `the claimant was eligible to make an election under section 77.98 in respect of the benefit period`
    AND `the day on which the benefit period began` BELOW (YearMonthDay 2016 8 7)
    AND (CONSIDER `the day on which the benefit period ended, if it has`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
         WHEN JUST ended THEN ended ABOVE (YearMonthDay 2016 8 7))
    AND `the day on which the last notification of payment or non-payment of benefits in respect of the benefit period is issued to the claimant` AT LEAST (YearMonthDay 2016 8 7)

